# functional_shorthands

Small Dart helpers for null handling, collections, and functional-style transformations.

## Installation

```yaml
dependencies:
  functional_shorthands:
    git:
      url: https://github.com/FabrizioG202/dart_packages
      path: functional_shorthands
```

## Usage

```dart
import 'package:functional_shorthands/functional_shorthands.dart';

String greet(String? name) => name.or('world').let((n) => 'Hello, $n!');

final byLength = ['one', 'four'].toMapBy((s) => s.length);
final updated = withValue(42)(0); // 42
```
